    "description": "Everything has another side<br>Urban Graphic Novel RPG &quot;CounterSide&quot;<br><br>A world where conflict never ends between Counters and Corrupted Objects after the Administration Failure<br>We invite you to a journey to save the Reality.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Attractive Characters and Illustrations</strong></h2>High-end Live2D quality illustrations with Korean and Japanese voices! <br>Save the ruined world with these charming characters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ A True Masterpiece</strong></h2>A magnificent SF noir saga, [Mainstream]<br>[Counter Case] and [Substream] to enhance each character's charm<br>Don't miss out on the CounterSide's urban fantasy ensemble!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ High Quality 2D Animation Line Battle</strong></h2>Brilliant motions and skill cut-ins spice up the breathtaking line battles!<br>Lead the squads to victory with your strategy and your team's brilliance.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Beautifully Composed Grandoise BGM</strong></h2>Grand yet exquisite BGMs to every situation in the story to enhance the immersion! <br>Why not play CounterSide with unique BGMs?",
