    "game": "epic_seven",
    "name": "Epic Seven",
    "appId": 5019180,
    "source": "https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails?appids=5019180&l=english",
    "description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019180/extras/fc0625693b5dc1ac8348fc7714d949e9.poster.avif?t=1793256460\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019180/extras/fc0625693b5dc1ac8348fc7714d949e9.webm?t=1793256460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019180/extras/fc0625693b5dc1ac8348fc7714d949e9.mp4?t=1793256460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><br> <br><strong>● PLAY THE ANIMATION — An anime RPG enjoyed by 20 million players worldwide!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diche, the Goddess of Life, shared her power to bring the Heir of the Covenant and the Guardians into this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Heir, protect the world.&quot; — We invite you to the Seventh World, an epic saga crafted by master storytellers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic Seven is a Hero collection RPG that blends hand-drawn, full-frame 2D animation with deep, strategic turn-based combat. Collect and build hundreds of unique Heroes, and experience battles that play like a cinematic anime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019180/extras/678709b1e07ea2e8022b1b1c9d9249f9.poster.avif?t=1793256460\" width=820 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019180/extras/678709b1e07ea2e8022b1b1c9d9249f9.webm?t=1793256460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019180/extras/678709b1e07ea2e8022b1b1c9d9249f9.mp4?t=1793256460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>● Cinematic Anime Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Seven's signature full-frame 2D animation! The moment a Hero casts their Ultimate, dazzling hand-drawn cutscenes come to life frame by frame. Experience breathtaking animations with every skill you unleash.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019180/extras/325f6a0e69da939ca7d0ca1609ab98be.poster.avif?t=1793256460\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019180/extras/325f6a0e69da939ca7d0ca1609ab98be.webm?t=1793256460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019180/extras/325f6a0e69da939ca7d0ca1609ab98be.mp4?t=1793256460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>● An Expansive and Beautiful Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An epic saga crafted by master storytellers. From the main storyline to the hidden backstories of your Heroes, countless tales breathe life into the Seventh World. Immerse yourself in this rich and expansive world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019180/extras/8f64cace0cc70d519cc557cea71e4a69.poster.avif?t=1793256460\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019180/extras/8f64cace0cc70d519cc557cea71e4a69.webm?t=1793256460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019180/extras/8f64cace0cc70d519cc557cea71e4a69.mp4?t=1793256460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>● Strategic Turn-Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory is earned through strategy, not brute force. Master skill timing, balance Effectiveness and Effect Resistance, and outwit your opponents in the strategic Ban Pick phase. Every decision can determine the outcome of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019180/extras/e7913d42e1a1cba6119b25c3d9eb7888.poster.avif?t=1793256460\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019180/extras/e7913d42e1a1cba6119b25c3d9eb7888.webm?t=1793256460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019180/extras/e7913d42e1a1cba6119b25c3d9eb7888.mp4?t=1793256460\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>● World Arena — Real-Time PvP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against players from around the world in intense real-time strategic battles. The battle begins with the Ban Pick phase, where reading your opponent's team composition and making the right draft decisions are the keys to victory.</p>",
